OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Flikely tonight, allowing another cold
OL,7,Fnight with a widespread frost
OL,8,Fdeveloping. Perhaps some spots of rain
OL,9,For drizzle, mainly over high ground in
OL,10,Fthe west. Breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FAnother cold feeling day,
OL,13,Fwith a strengthening breeze. A mixture
OL,14,Fof cloud and sunny spells, with any
OL,15,Fearly rain over high ground in the
OL,16,Fnorthwest soon clearing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
