OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled with rain or showers and
OL,7,Fstronger winds, mixed with some drier
OL,8,Fand brighter intervals. Briefly milder
OL,9,FSunday, but turning colder again with
OL,10,Fa risk of snow on higher ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
